; The places of an amount worked out by balancing: the sum's own places, but at least the display precision
; of the amounts it was made from (a written amount's is its places; a price's is the price's).
2026-01-01 zero in the middle of the sum
    a  1.25 C
    b  -1.25 C
    c  3 C
    d

2026-01-02 whole term after
    a  1.25 C
    b  3 C
    c  -1.25 C
    d

2026-01-03 unit prices
    a  10 Z @ 2.50 W
    b

2026-01-04 unit prices grouped, the first price gives the places
    a  3 Q @ 1.5 R
    b  2 Q @ 1.50 R
    c

2026-01-05 totals, the most places
    a  1 X @@ 1.50 Y
    b  1 X @@ 1.5 Y
    c

2026-01-06 another place for R elsewhere changes nothing
    f  0.001 R
    g  -0.001 R

2026-01-07 an assignment lists the places of the difference
    n1  2.00 X = 2.00 X
    b

2026-01-08 and so does a difference from a balance
    n2  = 7.5 X
    b

2026-01-09 second
    n2  = 9 X
    b

2026-01-10 total assignment
    n2  == 0.00
    b
